            <property name="text">
             <string>About the import</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_import_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>&lt;b&gt;Adding the annotations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The annotations of the text file are added to the accessory file of its PSG file. Snooz first removes, on every channel, the annotations of the accessory file that have the same group and name as an imported annotation.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Default values&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The default values of "Text File Format" read a text file written like a Snooz accessory file. It has these columns.&lt;br/&gt;• group is the category of the annotation, for example spindle.&lt;br/&gt;• name is its text label, for example spindle_a7.&lt;br/&gt;• start_sec is its onset in seconds, for example 300.&lt;br/&gt;• duration_sec is its duration in seconds, for example 0.9.&lt;br/&gt;• channels is the list of its channels, for example [C3-A2].</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
